{"seq":3,"slug":"chassis-cell-engineering","title":"底盘细胞工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/synthetic-biology-foundations/chassis-cell-engineering","wordCount":1529,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"底盘细胞工程\">底盘细胞工程</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>任何合成生物学设计最终都需要在一个活的细胞中运行——这个承载工程化功能的宿主就是&quot;底盘细胞&quot;（chassis cell）。选择与改造底盘细胞直接决定了目标产物的表达水平、细胞鲁棒性和工业可放大性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"主流底盘细胞比较\">主流底盘细胞比较</h3><p>不同底盘细胞各有其独特优势与局限，选择取决于目标产物类型与生产场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>底盘细胞</th>\n<th>倍增时间</th>\n<th>遗传工具成熟度</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n<th>主要局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大肠杆菌（<em>E. coli</em>）</td>\n<td>~20 min</td>\n<td>★★★★★</td>\n<td>氨基酸、小分子化学品、蛋白药</td>\n<td>无翻译后修饰、内毒素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酿酒酵母（<em>S. cerevisiae</em>）</td>\n<td>~90 min</td>\n<td>★★★★☆</td>\n<td>萜类、有机酸、蛋白表达</td>\n<td>分泌效率低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>毕赤酵母（<em>P. pastoris</em>）</td>\n<td>~120 min</td>\n<td>★★★☆☆</td>\n<td>高密度发酵蛋白表达</td>\n<td>甲醇诱导安全性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHO细胞</td>\n<td>~20 h</td>\n<td>★★★★☆</td>\n<td>抗体、糖蛋白药物</td>\n<td>培养成本高、遗传不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>枯草芽孢杆菌（<em>B. subtilis</em>）</td>\n<td>~30 min</td>\n<td>★★★☆☆</td>\n<td>工业酶分泌</td>\n<td>蛋白酶丰富</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>谷氨酸棒杆菌（<em>C. glutamicum</em>）</td>\n<td>~60 min</td>\n<td>★★★☆☆</td>\n<td>氨基酸大宗生产</td>\n<td>代谢工具较少</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"crispr-cas基因编辑系统\">CRISPR-Cas基因编辑系统</h3><p>CRISPR-Cas是底盘改造的核心工具，已发展出多种变体适应不同需求：</p>\n<p><strong>CRISPR-Cas9</strong>：经典双链断裂（DSB）机制，结合同源重组修复（HDR）实现精确敲入/敲除。在大肠杆菌中可实现无标记单基因敲除效率&gt;90%。</p>\n<p><strong>CRISPR-Cas12a（Cpf1）</strong>：产生粘性末端，crRNA更短且可自行加工polycrRNA阵列，适合多位点同步编辑。</p>\n<p><strong>碱基编辑器（Base Editor）</strong>：融合脱氨酶的dCas9，在不产生DSB的情况下实现单碱基C→T或A→G转换，降低细胞毒性与脱靶效应。</p>\n<p><strong>先导编辑（Prime Editing）</strong>：融合逆转录酶的nCas9，无需供体DNA即可实现任意小片段的精确插入、删除与替换。</p>\n<p>多位点编辑策略：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>总编辑效率</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>毒性损失率</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{总编辑效率} = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} \\eta_i \\times (1 - \\text{毒性损失率})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总编辑效率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">毒性损失率</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>为第<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>个位点的编辑效率。当<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&gt;5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>时，需采用迭代轮次或筛选策略。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代谢背景简化\">代谢背景简化</h3><p>天然微生物携带大量非必需代谢途径，占用碳源与能量：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>竞争途径敲除</strong>：删除副产物合成基因（如大肠杆菌的<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ldhA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pflB</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">adhE</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>减少乙酸、乳酸积累）</li>\n<li><strong>基因组精简（Genome Reduction）</strong>：系统性删除移动元件（IS序列）、前噬菌体、冗余基因，可精简10-40%基因组。MDS42（精简大肠杆菌）比野生型减少约14%基因组，遗传稳定性显著提升</li>\n<li><strong>必需基因保护</strong>：基于Tn-seq或CRISPRi筛选确定条件必需基因集，避免过度精简</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"鲁棒性与正交化改造\">鲁棒性与正交化改造</h3><p>工业发酵环境远比实验室苛刻，底盘细胞需具备环境鲁棒性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>胁迫耐受工程</strong>：通过适应性进化（ALE）或全局转录因子改造（gTME），提升细胞对高温、低pH、有机溶剂或产物毒性的耐受</li>\n<li><strong>遗传稳定性</strong>：删除重组酶基因（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">recA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>）、加入毒素-抗毒素系统防止质粒丢失、使用基因组整合替代质粒表达</li>\n<li><strong>正交化代谢</strong>：引入非天然辅因子或正交核糖体，使工程途径与宿主代谢解耦，减少代谢负担（metabolic burden）</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;野生型底盘&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;竞争途径敲除&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;基因组精简&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;胁迫耐受进化&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;正交化改造&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;工业级底盘细胞&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"野生型底盘\"] --&gt; B[\"竞争途径敲除\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"基因组精简\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"胁迫耐受进化\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"正交化改造\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"工业级底盘细胞\"]</pre><h3 id=\"新兴底盘平台\">新兴底盘平台</h3><p>传统模式生物之外，非模式底盘因独特代谢能力受到关注：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>产油酵母（<em>Y. lipolytica</em>）</strong>：天然高通量脂质代谢，适合脂肪酸衍生物生产</li>\n<li><strong>甲烷氧化菌</strong>：直接利用天然气作碳源，成本优势显著</li>\n<li><strong>光合微生物（蓝细菌）</strong>：以CO₂和光为唯一碳源与能源，绿色性极佳</li>\n<li><strong>无细胞系统（Cell-free）</strong>：完全脱离活细胞约束，适合有毒产物合成与快速原型验证</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026年底盘细胞工程领域重要进展：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>天津大学合成生物学团队构建了全基因组重编码大肠杆菌（64密码子压缩至57），释放7个密码子用于非天然氨基酸编码</li>\n<li>深圳先进院发布&quot;Chassis 2.0&quot;平台——集成AI辅助设计、自动化编辑与高通量表征的底盘细胞快速定制流水线</li>\n<li>CRISPR-Cas系统在工业酿酒酵母中实现单轮18位点同步编辑，效率&gt;50%</li>\n<li>合成基因组赋能的SCRaMbLE技术在高通量表型筛选中发现新的耐酸性突变组合</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>你需要生产一种需要糖基化修饰的治疗性蛋白。从大肠杆菌、酿酒酵母和CHO细胞中选择底盘，给出你的推理过程。</li>\n<li>解释为什么基因组精简能提升底盘细胞的遗传稳定性。从IS元件跳跃、同源重组、基因组复制准确性三个机制分析。</li>\n<li>设计一个实验方案，使用适应性实验室进化（ALE）提升大肠杆菌对丁醇（产物）的耐受浓度从1%到3%（v/v）。</li>\n<li>无细胞系统相比活细胞底盘有哪些独特优势？它的主要限制是什么？</li>\n<li>多位点CRISPR编辑中，为什么编辑效率随位点数增加而急剧下降？有哪些策略可以缓解这一问题？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>底盘细胞是合成生物学设计落地的物质载体。选择合适的底盘需综合考量遗传可操作性、代谢适配性与工业化要求。CRISPR-Cas工具家族使精确多位点改造成为常规操作，而代谢背景简化与鲁棒性改造则确保工程功能在工业环境中稳定运行。新兴底盘（产油酵母、甲烷氧化菌、无细胞系统）正在拓展生物制造的原料边界和应用场景。底盘工程的终极目标是构建&quot;可编程的生命硬件平台&quot;——如同计算机芯片一样可靠、可预测、可复用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"底盘细胞工程","id":"底盘细胞工程"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"主流底盘细胞比较","id":"主流底盘细胞比较"},{"level":3,"text":"CRISPR-Cas基因编辑系统","id":"crispr-cas基因编辑系统"},{"level":3,"text":"代谢背景简化","id":"代谢背景简化"},{"level":3,"text":"鲁棒性与正交化改造","id":"鲁棒性与正交化改造"},{"level":3,"text":"新兴底盘平台","id":"新兴底盘平台"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基因回路设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/synthetic-biology-foundations/gene-circuit-design"},"next":{"title":"代谢通路设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/metabolic-engineering/metabolic-pathway-design"}}